1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,300
Brain scan से क्या पता चलता है?

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,000
Amygdala research में answer simple नहीं

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Context = cue या event की situation

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
एक human study में दो virtual environments

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
एक shock-associated, दूसरा comparison

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Skin conductance, ratings और BOLD compare हुए

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,500
Amygdala और hippocampus signals अलग दिखे

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:35,000
तीन layers अलग रखिए

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Skin conductance = physiological response
Rating = participant की report

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,500
BOLD indirect signal है

11
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,000
Neurons, thoughts या emotion की direct recording नहीं

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Connectivity model = statistical relation
Direct wiring नहीं

13
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:56,500
2021 review methods अलग करती है

14
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,500
2024 appraisal fMRI पर caution देती है

15
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,700
एक scan = final emotion proof नहीं

16
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,700
Context, method और inference पूछिए

17
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,650
Educational reel; diagnosis या treatment advice नहीं
Visuals conceptual हैं, literal scan नहीं
